    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d808">

                <pb facs="0704" n="692" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg692"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.24/255: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-04-10T20:00:00+03:00">April 10, 1942—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:31 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>251. British Ambassador<anchor n="22" xml:id="d808-f1"/> informed me today that
                    in connection with furnishing of supplies to Turkey he had received instructions
                    from his Government that this subject would be dealt with in Ankara, with the
                    exception that requirements which British authorities do not undertake to supply
                    from the United Kingdom will be considered by the United States authorities in
                    Washington, if necessary, with the British or Turkish Embassies.</p>
                <pb facs="0705" n="693" xml:id="pg693"/>
                <p>The Ambassador’s instructions further provided that he is to endeavor to induce
                    Turkish Government to accept this procedure.</p>
                <p>He requested me to advise him if and when I receive instructions to like
                    effect.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d808-f1" n="22" xml:id="d808-f1-content">
